      "scope": "change",
      "made_by": "leader",
      "decision": "One serial wave for T1-T9 + T12, not parallel sub-tasks",
      "why": "design.md D4: renaming an exported interface has no intermediate state where go build passes. Parallel workers would each see an uncompilable tree."
    },
    {
      "id": "CD2",
      "at": "2026-09-03T10:50:00Z",
      "scope": "change",
      "made_by": "leader",
      "decision": "Grant the telemetry worker 4 explicit paths outside its module: internal/app/{app.go,processor.go,processor_test.go} and cmd/poller/main.go",
      "why": "Compilation requires them in the same dispatch (CD1). Comment-only cross-module tasks T10/T11/T13 stay leader-owned, so the grant is exactly what the compiler forces."
    }
